.TH LARSANA 1 "October 2026" "LARSANA 1.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
larsana \- local web development desktop for Linux
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B larsana
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage isolated Apache or Nginx, PHP-FPM and MariaDB runtimes from a compact Qt desktop.
Run as a normal user. Install runtime packages before starting services.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --doctor
Print installed runtimes and settings as JSON without starting services.
Live service state is displayed in the desktop application.
.TP
.B --version
Print the application version.
.SH FILES
Configuration, logs and database data follow the XDG directories under larsana.
The default project directory is ~/Larsana/www.
